BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (  In the beginning, there were two rivers: the River of Giving and the River of Returning. Each ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    flowed from a different mountain, never meeting, never mingling.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (  The River of Giving was blessed by the Sun God, who each dawn placed five golden drops into it) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    s source. The river could choose to send these drops downstream or keep them in its pools. W) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    hen drops traveled downstream, they multiplied threefold by the time they reached the valley) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
