BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  The River of Returning dwelt in that valley, receiving whatever the River of Giving sent. Upon) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (     receiving the multiplied waters, the River of Returning faced a choice: to hold the abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ce or send some back upstream to its benefactor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  For many seasons, both rivers were cautious. The River of Giving sent little, fearing loss. Th) Tj ET
