BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      Both drank deeply that day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      They returned each dawn, sometimes as Giver, sometimes as Keeper. They learned that genero) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        sity multiplied, that fair return sustained trust, and that together they could transfor) Tj ET
