BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      # The Weaver and the River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      In ancient times, the goddess Elara discovered a silver river that flowed between two vill) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        ages. The river possessed a miraculous quality: any gift cast into its waters would trip) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        le before reaching the opposite shore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The first village elder, hesitant and fearful, tossed only a single copper coin into the c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        urrent. It became three on the far bank. The receiving village, grateful but cautious, r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        eturned one coin. Both villages remained as they were-surviving, but not thriving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      Then a young weaver approached the river. She had only five threads of silk, all she owned) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        . "Trust requires courage," she whispered, casting three threads into the waters. They b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        ecame nine by the time they reached the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The receiving village saw her faith. They returned six threads, keeping three for their ow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        n needs. The weaver smiled-she now had eight threads instead of five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      Over many seasons, both villages learned the river's true lesson: abundance flows not from) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (         hoarding, but from the sacred balance of trust and reciprocity. Those who gave generous) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ly received generously in return, while those who clutched their coins remained forever ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      The silver river still flows, waiting for those brave enough to believe.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    reasoning:) Tj ET
