BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      t. The threefold waters revived the River of Returning, who gratefully sent half back upst) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      ream. Both rivers swelled with abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    From that day forward, the rivers understood: trust multiplies blessings, and reciprocity cr) Tj ET
