BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      They returned each dawn, sometimes as Giver, sometimes as Keeper. They learned that genero) Tj ET
