BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      For many seasons, both rivers were cautious. The River of Giving sent little, fearing loss) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        . The River of Returning kept much, fearing scarcity. Both remained shallow and weak.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
