BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        t we needed only one to quench our thirst. Let us return two measures-more than was give) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        n, yet keeping what we need.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The water flowed back, and Briar's original gift returned doubled.) Tj ET
