BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      But the spring whispered: "Trust creates abundance. Hoarding creates scarcity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
