BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      Both drank deeply that day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      They returned each dawn, sometimes as Giver, sometimes as Keeper. They learned that genero) Tj ET
