BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      In the time before time, two rivers flowed through a barren valley-the River of Giving and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (         the River of Return. Each was controlled by a spirit: Sender, who dwelled upstream, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (         Receiver, who lived below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      Sender discovered a magical property: any water released downstream would triple in volume) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (         by the time it reached Receiver's domain. But Sender feared: "If I send my waters, will) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (         anything flow back to sustain me?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      So Sender sent only a trickle. It tripled, yes, but Receiver, seeing so little trust, retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        rned nothing. Both rivers ran dry, and the valley remained barren.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      One season, Sender took courage and released a generous flow. The waters tripled magnifice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        ntly, filling Receiver's pools with abundance. Receiver, moved by this trust, sent back ) Tj ET
