BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      Sender's basin was replenished, and there was enough to give again. Each cycle of giving a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        nd returning made their waters stronger. The valley bloomed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      The spirits learned: the multiplication of gifts only creates abundance when trust flows b) Tj ET
