BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a vast desert. Each possessed a magical ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        well that could multiply whatever was poured into it threefold, but the wells had a pecu) Tj ET
