BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        e.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      During the first great drought, the Northern village faced a choice. They could hoard thei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        r precious water or send it across the desert, trusting it would return. Elder Hana spok) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        e: "True abundance flows like water in a circle, not gold locked in a vault.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      They sent half their reserves. The Southern village received triple the amount, their well) Tj ET
