BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        iginally sent, keeping enough for their own needs but honoring the gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      Season after season, both villages prospered. When either sent generously, the other retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        ned fairly. The desert bloomed with their shared abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
