BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        n, yet keeping what we need.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      The water flowed back, and Briar's original gift returned doubled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
