BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      Myth: In the time before memory, Cyra tended the Garden of Mirrors, where every seed plant) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        ed would triple in the soil below. The goddess taught her: "What you sow in trust, you r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        eap in abundance-but only if both gardener and earth honor the covenant.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      One day, Elara came from distant lands, carrying five seeds. She had heard whispers of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         miraculous garden but feared deception. "I will plant three," she decided, "and keep tw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        o for safety.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      Cyra watched the seeds multiply into nine golden blooms. She understood Elara's courage in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         risking more than half her treasure. "Trust begets trust," Cyra whispered, returning fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ve blooms to Elara.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      Elara's eyes widened-she now held seven where once she had five. Cyra kept four, also more) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (         than she began with. Both smiled, understanding the garden's secret.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
