BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages lay on opposite sides of a sacred spring. The spring had a ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        mysterious property: any water poured into it from one side would flow to the other side) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (         tripled in volume.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      The First Village discovered this magic. Their elder, wise in the ways of scarcity, feared) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        : "If we pour our water into the spring, we give away what is ours. What if the Other Vi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        llage keeps it all?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      So they poured nothing, and received nothing in return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      But one day, a young villager named Briar stepped forward. "I will trust," she said, and p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        oured her water into the spring. It flowed across, tripled, to the Other Village.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      The Other Village marveled at this gift. Their elder said, "We received three measures, bu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        t we needed only one to quench our thirst. Let us return two measures-more than was give) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        n, yet keeping what we need.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      The water flowed back, and Briar's original gift returned doubled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      Soon both villages understood: the spring rewarded trust with abundance. The more they pou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        red, the more they returned, the more both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      The spring still flows today, reminding us that prosperity springs not from hoarding, but ) Tj ET
