BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      In ancient times, the goddess Elara discovered a silver river that flowed between two vill) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        ages. The river possessed a miraculous quality: any gift cast into its waters would trip) Tj ET
