BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      Two wanderers, the Giver and the Keeper, discovered this spring on the same day. The Giver) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (         carried a precious flask, refilled each dawn with five measures of water. The Keeper ca) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        rried an empty vessel but possessed the strength to draw from the deep spring.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
