BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      Cyra and Briar had each walked separate paths to the same summit. Both learned that eight ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        is honorable, but nine is sacred. Both had received complete trust and answered with tra) Tj ET
