BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      The goddess whispered: "Good. But this is only half the circle.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      In the second exchange, Cyra planted five-not testing Briar, but honoring them. She knew B) Tj ET
