BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        h of Nine walked without exception.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      The garden held its breath for a different reason than before. Not "will trust be honored?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        " but "what happens when two legends meet?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      Briar received fifteen and returned nine, completing the perfect circle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      The goddess declared: "This is the garden's highest form-when both souls understand that p) Tj ET
